description: gpy config
expression: help
---
Configuration management

Usage: gpy config <COMMAND>

Commands:
  show    Show configuration
  get     Get a config value
  set     Set a config value
  open    Open the config file in your editor
  wizard  Launch the interactive configuration wizard (theme, palette, segments, live preview)
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
